The regular production option code changes from

62
00:02:22,031 --> 00:02:23,885
L three B to L four B.

63
00:02:24,065 --> 00:02:25,469
In plain language,

64
00:02:25,469 --> 00:02:28,355
General Motors has given the engine a

65
00:02:28,355 --> 00:02:29,057
