The point is that the Colorado has

283
00:10:59,462 --> 00:11:00,518
a clear ladder,

284
00:11:00,518 --> 00:11:02,772
and most buyers will find a step

285
00:11:02,772 --> 00:11:03,476
that fits.

286
00:11:03,826 --> 00:11:06,809
The destination charge deserves a word.

287
00:11:06,989 --> 00:11:09,673
All the prices we quoted include a

288
00:11:09,673 --> 00:11:12,435
destination charge of two thousand,

289
00:11:12,435 --> 00:11:14,013
ninety-five dollars.

290
00:11:14,193 --> 00:11:16,412
That means the truck's own price is

291
00:11:16,412 --> 00:11:17,680
lower than it looks,

292
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,963
and the number on the window sticker

293
00:11:19,963 --> 00:11:22,689
is higher than an advertisement that leaves

294
00:11:22,689 --> 00:11:23,133
it out.

295
00:11:23,313 --> 00:11:26,668
When you compare quotes from different dealers,

296
00:11:26,668 --> 00:11:29,380
always ask for the out-the-door price,

297
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:31,521
which includes taxes and fees.

298
00:11:31,701 --> 00:11:33,838
It is the only number that lets

299
00:11:33,838 --> 00:11:36,043
you compare two offers honestly.

300
00:11:36,394 --> 00:11:39,588
Think also about the engine question in

301
00:11:39,588 --> 00:11:40,898
practical terms.

302
00:11:41,078 --> 00:11:44,047
A new engine code could mean nothing

303
00:11:44,047 --> 00:11:45,201
for the owner,

304
00:11:45,201 --> 00:11:47,757
or it could mean a small change

305
00:11:47,757 --> 00:11:49,983
in emissions or durability.

306
00:11:50,163 --> 00:11:52,148
While we wait for Chevrolet,

307
00:11:52,148 --> 00:11:54,345
the safest move for a buyer who

308
00:11:54,345 --> 00:11:56,471
wants an early build is to ask

309
00:11:56,471 --> 00:11:59,448
the dealer for written confirmation of the

310
00:11:59,448 --> 00:12:02,354
warranty, and to read the coverage terms.

311
00:12:02,534 --> 00:12:05,620
The GM powertrain warranty details are not

312
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:07,311
in the sources we used,

313
00:12:07,311 --> 00:12:10,324
so check them on the manufacturer's site.

314
00:12:10,674 --> 00:12:12,612
And remember the buying calendar.

315
00:12:12,792 --> 00:12:15,757
The last twenty twenty-six trucks were built

316
00:12:15,757 --> 00:12:17,172
on October sixteenth,

317
00:12:17,172 --> 00:12:20,069
and the twenty twenty-seven trucks begin on

318
00:12:20,069 --> 00:12:21,349
October nineteenth.

319
00:12:21,529 --> 00:12:23,851
That means the first weeks of the

320
00:12:23,851 --> 00:12:26,174
new model year will have very few

321
00:12:26,174 --> 00:12:27,722
trucks on dealer lots,

322
00:12:27,722 --> 00:12:29,551
and orders will take time.

323
00:12:29,731 --> 00:12:31,845
A buyer in a hurry should look

324
00:12:31,845 --> 00:12:34,099
at a leftover twenty twenty-six,

325
00:12:34,099 --> 00:12:36,142
and a buyer who wants the new

326
00:12:36,142 --> 00:12:38,537
truck should place an order and be

327
00:12:38,537 --> 00:12:39,101
patient.

328
00:12:39,451 --> 00:12:41,998
Last, think about how you will use

329
00:12:41,998 --> 00:12:42,748
the truck.

330
00:12:42,928 --> 00:12:45,228
The Colorado is crew cab only,

331
00:12:45,228 --> 00:12:46,531
with a short bed,

332
00:12:46,531 --> 00:12:49,062
and it tows up to seven thousand,

333
00:12:49,062 --> 00:12:50,672
seven hundred pounds.

334
00:12:50,852 --> 00:12:52,817
If you need a long bed,

335
00:12:52,817 --> 00:12:54,185
an extended cab,

336
00:12:54,185 --> 00:12:55,210
or a diesel,

337
00:12:55,210 --> 00:12:57,005
look at other trucks.

338
00:12:57,185 --> 00:12:59,881
If you want a strong turbo engine

339
00:12:59,881 --> 00:13:02,494
and a good off-road package in a

340
00:13:02,494 --> 00:13:03,965
single body style,

341
00:13:03,965 --> 00:13:06,334
the Colorado makes it simple.

342
00:13:06,514 --> 00:13:08,995
The lack of choice is a feature

343
00:13:08,995 --> 00:13:12,197
for buyers who dislike spending hours on

344
00:13:12,197 --> 00:13:13,398
a configurator.

345
00:13:13,749 --> 00:13:16,163
So who should buy a Colorado?

346
00:13:16,343 --> 00:13:19,391
Someone who wants a midsize truck with

347
00:13:19,391 --> 00:13:22,198
strong power, a high tow rating and

348
00:13:22,198 --> 00:13:24,122
a good off-road package.

349
00:13:24,302 --> 00:13:26,772
The Trail Boss and the ZR2 are

350
00:13:26,772 --> 00:13:27,924
the favorites.

351
00:13:28,104 --> 00:13:29,231
And who should wait?

352
00:13:29,411 --> 00:13:31,591
Anyone who needs to know what the

353
00:13:31,591 --> 00:13:33,045
new engine code means,

354
00:13:33,045 --> 00:13:35,622
and anyone who wants a published price.

355
00:13:35,802 --> 00:13:38,540
Chevrolet opened the order books for the

356
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:40,525
twenty twenty-seven Colorado,

357
00:13:40,525 --> 00:13:43,058
but the sources give no on-sale date.

358
00:13:43,409 --> 00:13:45,009
If you are comparing,

359
00:13:45,009 --> 00:13:47,524
remember what we saw in the sales

360
00:13:47,524 --> 00:13:48,134
numbers.

361
00:13:48,314 --> 00:13:50,605
The Tacoma sells far more than the

362
00:13:50,605 --> 00:13:53,503
Colorado, and the Frontier is growing fast.

363
00:13:53,683 --> 00:13:55,668
And the Canyon is the same truck

364
00:13:55,668 --> 00:13:58,026
as the Colorado with a different look.

365
00:13:58,206 --> 00:14:00,467
So the choice is partly about the

366
00:14:00,467 --> 00:14:01,838
dealer and the deal,

367
00:14:01,838 --> 00:14:03,140
not only the truck.

368
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:05,941
Get quotes on both the Colorado and

369
00:14:05,941 --> 00:14:08,787
the Canyon, and compare the same trim,

370
00:14:08,787 --> 00:14:10,434
with the same options,

371
00:14:10,434 --> 00:14:11,633
on the same day.

372
00:14:11,983 --> 00:14:14,926
Let us explain the engine code change

373
00:14:14,926 --> 00:14:17,154
in terms of what a buyer can

374
00:14:17,154 --> 00:14:17,393
do.

375
00:14:17,573 --> 00:14:19,880
You cannot read the inside of an

376
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:22,403
engine, but you can read paperwork.

377
00:14:22,583 --> 00:14:24,913
Ask the dealer for the build date

378
00:14:24,913 --> 00:14:27,172
of the exact truck and ask which

379
00:14:27,172 --> 00:14:29,502
engine code appears on its order.

380
00:14:29,682 --> 00:14:31,429
Compare it with the code on a

381
00:14:31,429 --> 00:14:32,875
twenty twenty-six truck.

382
00:14:33,055 --> 00:14:34,660
If the code is different,

383
00:14:34,660 --> 00:14:36,779
you at least know you are looking

384
00:14:36,779 --> 00:14:38,256
at the changed version.

385
00:14:38,436 --> 00:14:40,436
That does not tell you what changed,

386
00:14:40,436 --> 00:14:42,214
but it tells you which truck you

387
00:14:42,214 --> 00:14:42,825
are buying.

388
00:14:43,175 --> 00:14:46,439
Now compare two prices that we already

389
00:14:46,439 --> 00:14:47,041
stated.

390
00:14:47,221 --> 00:14:50,147
The Trail Boss is forty-two thousand,

391
00:14:50,147 --> 00:14:52,757
five hundred ninety-five dollars,

392
00:14:52,757 --> 00:14:55,446
and the Z71 is forty-six thousand,

393
00:14:55,446 --> 00:14:57,345
six hundred ninety-five.

394
00:14:57,525 --> 00:15:00,187
The ZR2 is fifty-two thousand,

395
00:15:00,187 --> 00:15:02,494
seven hundred ninety-five.

396
00:15:02,674 --> 00:15:06,255
Each step brings more off-road equipment,

397
00:15:06,255 --> 00:15:08,875
but each step also costs a few

398
00:15:08,875 --> 00:15:10,359
thousand dollars.

399
00:15:10,539 --> 00:15:13,168
Ask yourself how often you will actually

400
00:15:13,168 --> 00:15:14,417
leave the pavement.

401
00:15:14,597 --> 00:15:16,376
If the answer is rarely,

402
00:15:16,376 --> 00:15:18,600
a lower trim may serve you for

403
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,415
less money.

404
00:15:19,766 --> 00:15:22,118
A common mistake is to buy the

405
00:15:22,118 --> 00:15:24,549
top trim for a feature you will

406
00:15:24,549 --> 00:15:25,176
not use.

407
00:15:25,356 --> 00:15:27,879
The ZR2 has ten point seven inches

408
00:15:27,879 --> 00:15:29,363
of ground clearance,

409
00:15:29,363 --> 00:15:32,405
which matters on rough trails and matters

410
00:15:32,405 --> 00:15:33,889
little on a commute.

411
00:15:34,069 --> 00:15:36,680
The Bison, at sixty-four thousand,

412
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:39,214
four hundred ninety-five dollars,

413
00:15:39,214 --> 00:15:41,825
is built for serious off-road use.

414
00:15:42,005 --> 00:15:44,898
If your driving is mostly highway and

415
00:15:44,898 --> 00:15:48,026
town, paying for that capability is like

416
00:15:48,026 --> 00:15:49,981
buying a boat for a pond.

417
00:15:50,161 --> 00:15:52,158
Be honest about your weekends.

418
00:15:52,508 --> 00:15:54,470
How should you read the towing figure?

419
00:15:54,650 --> 00:15:57,897
Seven thousand, seven hundred pounds is the

420
00:15:57,897 --> 00:16:01,372
maximum when the truck is properly configured.

421
00:16:01,552 --> 00:16:03,189
That means the right trim,

422
00:16:03,189 --> 00:16:05,708
the right drive and the right equipment.

423
00:16:05,888 --> 00:16:08,061
A Colorado you find on a lot

424
00:16:08,061 --> 00:16:09,069
may tow less.

425
00:16:09,249 --> 00:16:11,788
So before you buy for a specific

426
00:16:11,788 --> 00:16:14,644
trailer, find the number on the door

427
00:16:14,644 --> 00:16:16,866
sticker of that exact truck.

428
00:16:17,046 --> 00:16:19,199
Then compare it with the weight of

429
00:16:19,199 --> 00:16:21,859
your trailer, with the load already inside

430
00:16:21,859 --> 00:16:22,049
it.

431
00:16:22,229 --> 00:16:23,309
Leave a margin.

432
00:16:23,659 --> 00:16:26,015
Payload is the number people forget.

433
00:16:26,195 --> 00:16:29,515
Up to about seventeen hundred pounds sounds

434
00:16:29,515 --> 00:16:30,365
like a lot,

435
00:16:30,365 --> 00:16:32,295
until you add passengers,

436
00:16:32,295 --> 00:16:34,765
a toolbox, a tonneau cover and a

437
00:16:34,765 --> 00:16:37,004
tongue weight from a trailer.

438
00:16:37,184 --> 00:16:39,540
Payload is what the truck can carry

439
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:41,223
in the cab and in the bed

440
00:16:41,223 --> 00:16:41,828
together.

441
00:16:42,008 --> 00:16:44,014
If you use the truck for work,

442
00:16:44,014 --> 00:16:45,818
add up what you carry on an

443
00:16:45,818 --> 00:16:46,687
ordinary day.

444
00:16:46,867 --> 00:16:49,212
And again, read the sticker of the

445
00:16:49,212 --> 00:16:50,661
truck you are buying,

446
00:16:50,661 --> 00:16:52,730
not the maximum in a brochure.

447
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,052
Let us talk about the Canyon,

448
00:16:55,052 --> 00:16:57,161
since it is the same truck with

449
00:16:57,161 --> 00:16:58,385
a different badge.

450
00:16:58,565 --> 00:17:01,776
The Canyon is growing while the Colorado

451
00:17:01,776 --> 00:17:02,257
slips.

452
00:17:02,437 --> 00:17:04,792
That tells us the two trucks compete

453
00:17:04,792 --> 00:17:07,081
with each other for the same buyer.

454
00:17:07,261 --> 00:17:09,398
For you, that is useful.

455
00:17:09,578 --> 00:17:11,906
Ask both dealers for a quote on

456
00:17:11,906 --> 00:17:12,958
the same trim,

457
00:17:12,958 --> 00:17:14,610
with the same options,

458
00:17:14,610 --> 00:17:15,812
on the same day.

459
00:17:15,992 --> 00:17:17,710
Because the trucks match,

460
00:17:17,710 --> 00:17:20,389
any difference in price is a difference

461
00:17:20,389 --> 00:17:21,214
in the deal,

462
00:17:21,214 --> 00:17:22,656
and not in the truck.

463
00:17:23,007 --> 00:17:25,596
Think about the five G hotspot honestly.

464
00:17:25,776 --> 00:17:27,891
It sounds like a large upgrade,

465
00:17:27,891 --> 00:17:29,665
and for some people it is.

466
00:17:29,845 --> 00:17:32,390
But it normally needs a data plan,

467
00:17:32,390 --> 00:17:34,710
and the sources do not say what

468
00:17:34,710 --> 00:17:35,534
that costs.

469
00:17:35,714 --> 00:17:37,847
If you already have a phone plan

470
00:17:37,847 --> 00:17:39,048
with hotspot data,

471
00:17:39,048 --> 00:17:40,381
you may not need it.

472
00:17:40,561 --> 00:17:43,082
If you work remotely from the truck,

473
00:17:43,082 --> 00:17:45,112
it might be worth paying for.

474
00:17:45,292 --> 00:17:47,899
Either way, ask the dealer how long

475
00:17:47,899 --> 00:17:49,091
any trial lasts,

476
00:17:49,091 --> 00:17:51,028
and write down the answer.

477
00:17:51,378 --> 00:17:55,128
One more caution about colors and interiors.

478
00:17:55,308 --> 00:17:57,819
If you want Storm Gray Metallic,

479
00:17:57,819 --> 00:18:00,331
Nitron Blue or Serpent Metallic,

480
00:18:00,331 --> 00:18:03,785
the restrictions we described can block some

481
00:18:03,785 --> 00:18:04,491
pairings.

482
00:18:04,671 --> 00:18:08,021
A salesperson may promise a combination that

483
00:18:08,021 --> 00:18:10,534
the order system will not accept.

484
00:18:10,714 --> 00:18:13,002
Before you put down a deposit,

485
00:18:13,002 --> 00:18:16,128
ask to see the configuration confirmed on

486
00:18:16,128 --> 00:18:17,425
the order screen.

487
00:18:17,605 --> 00:18:20,221
A deposit is easier to give than

488
00:18:20,221 --> 00:18:21,203
to get back,

489
00:18:21,203 --> 00:18:23,328
so settle the color first.

490
00:18:23,679 --> 00:18:25,674
And a last view of the whole

491
00:18:25,674 --> 00:18:26,244
picture.

492
00:18:26,424 --> 00:18:28,559
The Colorado is a strong,

493
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:31,974
simple lineup with real choices on price

494
00:18:31,974 --> 00:18:33,937
and off-road equipment,

495
00:18:33,937 --> 00:18:36,328
and with two open questions.

496
00:18:36,508 --> 00:18:38,560
What did the engine change,

497
00:18:38,560 --> 00:18:41,829
and what will the twenty twenty-seven price

498
00:18:41,829 --> 00:18:42,057
be?

499
00:18:42,237 --> 00:18:44,788
If those questions matter to you,

500
00:18:44,788 --> 00:18:45,175
wait.

501
00:18:45,355 --> 00:18:46,325
If they do not,

502
00:18:46,325 --> 00:18:48,589
you can still make a smart purchase

503
00:18:48,589 --> 00:18:50,724
by comparing out-the-door prices,

504
00:18:50,724 --> 00:18:53,636
checking the sticker and getting the warranty

505
00:18:53,636 --> 00:18:54,736
terms in writing.

506
00:18:54,916 --> 00:18:57,354
Prepared buyers rarely overpay.

507
00:18:57,704 --> 00:18:59,743
Let us go through a sample plan

508
00:18:59,743 --> 00:19:01,059
for a careful buyer.

509
00:19:01,239 --> 00:19:04,618
Step one, decide whether you need the

510
00:19:04,618 --> 00:19:08,087
off-road trims or whether a Work Truck

511
00:19:08,087 --> 00:19:09,366
or LT will do.

512
00:19:09,546 --> 00:19:11,951
Step two, ask two dealers for the

513
00:19:11,951 --> 00:19:14,574
out-the-door price on the same trim,

514
00:19:14,574 --> 00:19:16,906
one for the Colorado and one for

515
00:19:16,906 --> 00:19:17,708
the Canyon.

516
00:19:17,888 --> 00:19:20,895
Step three, ask for the warranty terms

517
00:19:20,895 --> 00:19:21,765
in writing.

518
00:19:21,945 --> 00:19:25,069
Step four, read the door sticker for

519
00:19:25,069 --> 00:19:26,717
towing and payload.

520
00:19:26,897 --> 00:19:30,534
Step five, confirm the color and interior

521
00:19:30,534 --> 00:19:32,307
on the order screen.

522
00:19:32,487 --> 00:19:35,726
Five steps, and none of them cost

523
00:19:35,726 --> 00:19:36,609
anything.

524
00:19:36,959 --> 00:19:39,466
Finally, a word about patience.

525
00:19:39,646 --> 00:19:41,828
The first weeks of a new model

526
00:19:41,828 --> 00:19:44,592
year are when information is thinnest.

527
00:19:44,772 --> 00:19:47,066
Prices may not be published,

528
00:19:47,066 --> 00:19:50,098
the engine change may be unexplained,

529
00:19:50,098 --> 00:19:51,901
and trucks are scarce.

530
00:19:52,081 --> 00:19:54,320
A buyer who waits a little gets

531
00:19:54,320 --> 00:19:56,776
more facts, and a buyer who cannot

532
00:19:56,776 --> 00:20:00,026
wait gets a leftover twenty twenty-six truck,

533
00:20:00,026 --> 00:20:02,193
which we know a little better.

534
00:20:02,373 --> 00:20:04,091
Either choice is sensible.

535
00:20:04,271 --> 00:20:06,649
What is not sensible is paying for

536
00:20:06,649 --> 00:20:09,236
a new truck while guessing about what

537
00:20:09,236 --> 00:20:10,494
changed inside it.

538
00:20:10,845 --> 00:20:13,194
And if you remember only one idea

539
00:20:13,194 --> 00:20:14,333
from this video,

540
00:20:14,333 --> 00:20:15,686
let it be this one.

541
00:20:15,866 --> 00:20:18,674
Every number we quoted is a starting

542
00:20:18,674 --> 00:20:20,313
point, not an answer.

543
00:20:20,493 --> 00:20:23,627
Prices are before taxes and fees.

544
00:20:23,807 --> 00:20:25,549
Towing is a maximum.

545
00:20:25,729 --> 00:20:27,575
Payload depends on the sticker.

546
00:20:27,755 --> 00:20:29,891
The engine code is a question.

547
00:20:30,071 --> 00:20:32,330
When you walk into a dealership,

548
00:20:32,330 --> 00:20:34,519
bring these questions with you,

549
00:20:34,519 --> 00:20:36,848
and the answers will tell you far

550
00:20:36,848 --> 00:20:38,825
more than any advertisement.

551
00:20:39,005 --> 00:20:40,269
Good buyers ask,

552
00:20:40,269 --> 00:20:41,849
and then they check.

553
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,272
So what should you check before you

554
00:20:44,272 --> 00:20:46,344
buy a twenty twenty-seven Colorado?

555
00:20:46,524 --> 00:20:48,812
First, the official price.

556
00:20:48,992 --> 00:20:52,426
Second, the explanation for the engine code

557
00:20:52,426 --> 00:20:52,985
change.

558
00:20:53,165 --> 00:20:56,606
Third, whether your color and interior can

559
00:20:56,606 --> 00:20:57,589
be combined.

560
00:20:57,769 --> 00:21:00,758
And fourth, the exact towing and payload

561
00:21:00,758 --> 00:21:03,149
on the door sticker of the truck

562
00:21:03,149 --> 00:21:04,270
you are buying.

563
00:21:04,450 --> 00:21:07,566
The Twenty Twenty-Seven Truck Buyer's Guide has

564
00:21:07,566 --> 00:21:08,560
this checklist.

565
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:11,059
The link is in the description and

566
00:21:11,059 --> 00:21:12,560
in the pinned comment.

567
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:15,187
